    "text": "By Nic Flosi ,\n16 hours ago AURORA, Ill. - A two-vehicle crash on Interstate 88 in Aurora early Wednesday left two people dead and closed eastbound traffic for several hours, according to Illinois State Police. What we know:. Troopers responded around 12:45 a.m. to eastbound I-88 at Eola Road, near milepost 121, for a fatal crash... Read full article\n6",
